{{also|Fernsehen}}
==German==

===Etymology===
Compound of {{compound|de|fern|sehen}}, derived from the noun {{m|de|Fernsehen}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈfɛʁnˌzeː.ən/|aa=Germany,official standard, but rare}}
** {{audio|de|De-Fernsehen2.ogg|aa=Germany}}
* {{IPA|de|/ˈfɛʁnˌzeːn/|[ˈfɛʁnˌzeːn]|[ˈfɛɐ̯nˌzeːn]|aa=Germany,normal}}
** {{audio|de|De-Fernsehen.ogg|aa=Germany}}
* {{IPA|de|/ˈfɛʁnˌseːn/|[ˈfɛɐ̯n-]|aa=Austria,South German,Switzerland}}
** {{audio|de|De-at-Fernsehen.ogg|aa=Austria}}
* {{hyph|de|Fern|se|hen}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb|fern.sehen<sieht#sah,gesehen,sähe.longimp>}}

# {{lb|de|television}} to watch [[television]]
#: {{syn|de|fernschauen}}

====Usage notes====
''Fernsehen'' {{m|de|kucken}} or ''Fernsehen'' {{m|de|schauen}} are more common in spoken German. Since these constructions may be considered [[tautological]], formal German prefers the verb ''fernsehen''.

